  "locator": "Rollback procedures section",
  "quotation": "Rollback is a git revert — fast, auditable, and not dependent on tribal knowledge.",
  "originalText": "the diff was — all in git history.\n\n\n\n\nRollback is a \ngit revert\n — fast, auditable, and not dependent on tribal knowledge.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUse \nimage digest pinning\n in deployment manifests rather than mutable tags:\n\n\n\n\n# Prefer this (immutable):\n\n\nimage\n:\n \nmyregistry.io/myapp@sha256:a1b2c3d4...\n\n\n# Not this (mutable):\n\n\nimage\n:\n \nmyregistry.io/myapp:latest",
